#: ../../source/docs/common-upixels-upflow.rst:9
#: cf5f36f3337b479c8501602ec1e2f769
msgid ""
"The UPixels UPFlow optical flow sensor is a lightweight and low cost optical"
" flow sensor which can be used to improve horizontal position control "
"especially in GPS denied environments."
msgstr "UPixels UPFlow 光流传感器是一款轻便低成本的光流传感器，可用于改善水平位置控制，尤其在无 GPS 环境中。"

